cycle 1: c before = 0, a;b or b;a gives 3, hardware gives 1
UNSOUND: no serial execution of a and b gives 1
cycle 2: c before = 1, a;b or b;a gives 4, hardware gives 2
UNSOUND: no serial execution of a and b gives 2
cycle 3: c before = 2, a;b or b;a gives 5, hardware gives 3
UNSOUND: no serial execution of a and b gives 3
cycle 4: c before = 3, a;b or b;a gives 6, hardware gives 4
UNSOUND: no serial execution of a and b gives 4
